g secret is present since there's nothing to call).\n\nDocuments, in CORE-600-integration-studio.md §8, exactly why\nCommunication/Email (Teams, Slack, WhatsApp, Telegram, M365, Gmail)\naren't buildable from this workspace: COMM-1's source isn't code-present\nhere, and Core has no outbound client or base URL configured to reach\nthe remote Hermes /providers API that could otherwise surface their\nstatus. Recorded as a real blocker, not papered over.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-08-30T06:46:44-04:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/8a05ce7cdfbeec7cf9c7f0ccdf6aa398c80652a4","author":{"name":"Pavan","email":"pavan@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-08-30T06:46:44-04:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Pavan","email":"pavan@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-08-30T06:46:44-04:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["src/integration-studio/connectors/avionte.connector.ts","src/integration-studio/connectors/bullhorn.connector.ts","src/integration-studio/connectors/custom-api.connector.ts","src/integration-studio/connectors/jobdiva.connector.ts","src/integration-studio/connectors/oorwin.connector.ts","src/integration-studio/connectors/webhook.connector.ts"],"removed":["src/integration-studio/connectors/generic-rest.connector.ts"],"modified":["docs/integration-studio/CORE-600-integration-studio.md","docs/integration-studio/user-guide.md","scripts/generate-integration-studio-docs.ts","src/integration-studio/connectors/connector-registry.service.spec.ts","src/integration-studio/connectors/connector-registry.service.ts","src/integration-studio/integration-studio.module.ts"]}],"head_commit":{"id":"8a05ce7cdfbeec7cf9c7f0ccdf6aa398c80652a4","tree_id":"00709915230ab7c784a477d381b1ddd92f69476e","distinct":true,"message":"Add Oorwin, Bullhorn, JobDiva, Avionté connectors; split Custom API/Webhook\n\nExercises the Build Plan's Phase 6 gate four times over: each ATS\nconnector was added as a plugin with zero changes to connector.types.ts\nor connector-registry.service.ts, which is the actual evidence the\nframework is generic rather than CEIPAL-shaped underneath.\n\nSplits the former generic-rest.connector.ts into two connectors with\ngenuinely different shapes: custom-api.connector.ts (outbound polling)\nand webhook.connector.ts (inbound-only, testConnection just checks a\nsigning secret is present since there's nothing to call).\n\nDocuments, in CORE-600-integration-studio.md §8, exactly why\nCommunication/Email (Teams, Slack, WhatsApp, Telegram, M365, Gmail)\naren't buildable from this workspace: COMM-1's source isn't code-present\nhere, and Core has no outbound client or base URL configured to reach\nthe remote Hermes /providers API that could otherwise surface their\nstatus. Recorded as a real blocker, not papered over.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-08-30T06:46:44-04:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/8a05ce7cdfbeec7cf9c7f0ccdf6aa398c80652a4","author":{"name":"Pavan","email":"pavan@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-08-30T06:46:44-04:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Pavan","email":"pavan@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-08-30T06:46:44-04:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["src/integration-studio/connectors/avionte.connector.ts","src/integration-studio/connectors/bullhorn.connector.ts","src/integration-studio/connectors/custom-api.connector.ts","src/integration-studio/connectors/jobdiva.connector.ts","src/integration-studio/connectors/oorwin.connector.ts","src/integration-studio/connectors/webhook.connector.ts"],"removed":["src/integration-studio/connectors/generic-rest.connector.ts"],"modified":["docs/integration-studio/CORE-600-integration-studio.md","docs/integration-studio/user-guide.md","scripts/generate-integration-studio-docs.ts","src/integration-studio/connectors/connector-registry.service.spec.ts","src/integration-studio/connectors/connector-registry.service.ts"